		case Unauthenticated, Gone, BoardNotFound, StoreFailed, Forbidden, Invalid, BoardArchived, NotFound, TooLarge, SecretDetected, IdempotencyConflict, ReservedLabel, AlreadyTask, InvalidNeeds, TaskOwnerUntrusted:
